/Alt (Decision tree for secrets and certificates and keys. Secrets and certificates: independent regional read-write needs lead to Pattern 1; an eligible paired-region read-only recovery design leads to Pattern 2. Keys: external custody leads to Pattern 7; a shared replicated key store leads to Pattern 5 or Pattern 6 with BYOK; independent regional vaults lead to Pattern 3 or Pattern 4 with BYOK; eligible Microsoft-managed recovery leads to Pattern 1 for software protection or Pattern 2 for HSM protection. Validate consuming-service support first.)
/P 5579 0 R
/K 5587 0 R>>
